# 🌊 Java 8 Streams — Ek Baar Padho, Kabhi Mat Bhoolo

## 🧠 Sabse Pehle — Stream Kya Hota Hai? (Concept Clear Karo)

Imagine kar — tere paas **ek nali (pipe) hai** jisme se paani (data) beh raha hai. Tu us paani ko **filter kar sakta hai** (sirf saaf paani lena), **transform kar sakta hai** (garam karna), aur **collect kar sakta hai** (bottle mein bharna).

**Yahi hai Stream!**

> 📌 **Definition:** Stream ek sequence of elements hai jo functional-style operations support karta hai — jaise filtering, mapping, reducing.

3 Golden Rules yaad rakh:
1. **Stream data structure NAHI hai** — ye sirf ek "conveyor belt" hai data ke liye
2. **Original data modify NAHI karta** — naya sequence banata hai
3. **Java 8 mein aaya** — `java.util.stream.*` package mein

