## 🚀 PART 3 — Parallel Streams (Slide 12)

**Normal Stream:** Ek hi thread mein kaam karta hai (single worker)
**Parallel Stream:** Multiple threads mein kaam baant deta hai (multiple workers)

```java
List<Integer> numbers = Arrays.asList(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8);

int sum = numbers.parallelStream()  // bas .stream() ki jagah .parallelStream()!
                 .reduce(0, Integer::sum);
System.out.println(sum); // Output: 36
```

**Yaad rakh:** Sirf `.stream()` → `.parallelStream()` — bas itna hi change! Large datasets ke liye use karo.

