## 🧩 Sab Ek Saath — Method Chaining (Pipeline)

Stream ki asli taakat tab dikhti hai jab multiple operations chain karte hain:

```java
List<String> names = Arrays.asList("Alice", "Bob", "Charlie", "Adam", "Brian");

List<String> result = names.stream()
    .filter(n -> n.startsWith("A"))   // Step 1: 'A' se shuru hone waale lo
    .map(String::toUpperCase)          // Step 2: Uppercase karo
    .sorted()                          // Step 3: Sort karo
    .collect(Collectors.toList());     // Step 4: List mein collect karo

System.out.println(result); // Output: [ADAM, ALICE]
```

