## 🗺️ Quick Revision Map — Poora Topic Ek Nazar Mein

```
STREAM
  │
  ├── BANAO (Create)
  │     ├── collection.stream()
  │     ├── Arrays.stream(array)
  │     ├── Stream.of(values)
  │     ├── Stream.generate(supplier).limit(n)
  │     └── Stream.iterate(seed, func).limit(n)
  │
  ├── INTERMEDIATE OPS (lazy, return Stream)
  │     ├── filter(condition)    ← chhanno
  │     ├── map(function)        ← badlo
  │     ├── flatMap(function)    ← flatten karo
  │     ├── distinct()           ← duplicates hatao
  │     ├── sorted()             ← sort karo
  │     └── peek(action)         ← debug karo
  │
  └── TERMINAL OPS (eager, stream khatam)
        ├── forEach()            ← print/action
        ├── collect(toList())    ← List banao
        ├── reduce(0, func)      ← ek value mein milao
        ├── count()              ← count karo
        ├── max() / min()        ← .get() bhi lagao!
        ├── anyMatch()           ← koi ek?
        ├── allMatch()           ← sab?
        └── noneMatch()          ← koi nahi?

PARALLEL → .parallelStream() → fast for large data
GROUPING → .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(func)) → Map milega
```

